  "verseCount": 22,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "48",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 48"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "48",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyenu chumichi enu akwamutaŋa waYakoba, enu atumbawu ijina daIsarela, enu mwafuma mumeji amuYuda, mwasanyikaŋa ijina daYehova, mwatenaŋa Nzambi yaIsarela chakadi kutwala hela mwalala, hela mukuloŋa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "muloŋa wena aditenaŋa nawu, Tudi akwamukala wajila. Adikoleshelaŋa mudi Nzambi yaIsarela; ijina dindi diyi Yehova wamazaza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ami nashimuni dehi kufumisha kushankulu yuma yásambilili. Eŋa, yedikili mukanwa kami, niyimwekeshi irikuyi mwekesha, nayilili chakukasumwisha, yikoŋewa nikukoŋewa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa nelukili nami, Eyi wachinchika, nshiŋu yeyi yidi neyi mujila wachikuŋu, ihama devi didi neyi wuneŋu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi chinakushimwinumu kufumisha kushankulu, nakulejelumuhichadiŋa kanda chimwekani, nami wakenza kela neyi, Mukishiwami wakutuŋa diyi nachikoŋi, mukishi wami wakusoŋa, nimukishi wami wakusuŋununa, diwu anayileji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi wunachitiyi; talaku mwejimimu; indi enu mubuli kuchishimuna? Kufumisha hanu nukukulejaŋa yumayayiha, yuma yakujinda yiwunabuli kwiluka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anayileŋa katataka, bayi kushankuluku; kanda wuyitiyaloŋahu dehi, kushika nikwifuku dalelu; wakenza kela neyi, Nayilukili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eŋa, hiwachitiyiluku. Eŋa, hiwachilukiluku. Eŋa, kufumisha kunyaka itu deyi hidajikukiluku. Muloŋa ami nelukili chiwaswejelaŋa kukwatila akwenu makasu, kufumisha kwivu mudamama yeyi akutenenaŋa nawu wumukwakumotoka nshimbi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "China hachikikuzuwa kwami nalondi ijina dami, chinadiwunjiki naneyi kubulaku kufumishahu nalondi kunshimeka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyaku, nakukosi dehi nakesi, bayi dinu neyi silivaku. Nakutondi dehi muluteŋi lwamakabi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukuchikoŋela hamujimba wamami aweni, hamujimba wamami aweni kwaamu, ochu ajiloli ijina dami? Kulema kwami hinukukwinka wacheŋuku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi Yakoba, eyi Isarela wami natambika, ntiyilili. Diyi ami. Yami watachi, yami nawa wankumininaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eŋa, chikasa chami dichi chaalili chikuku cheseki, chikasa chami chachidiilu dichi chatanjikili mawulu. Chinayitambikaŋa hiyakwimana hamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pompenu wejima wenu mutiyi; wumu wudihi nashimuni yumiyi? Yehova namukeŋi; wakakoŋa Babiloni mwatiyayi kuwaha, wakakwata chikasa chindi hadi aKaladeya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ami yami nahoshi. Eŋa, yami inamutambiki. Yami inamuleti, diyi wakakoolekeshanjila yindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inzenu kwakwihi nanami mutiyi chuma; kufumisha kutachi hinahosheli kumbeŋuku; kufumisha kunyaka yadiŋi chumochu, kwoku nidi; ichi dinu Mwanta Nzambi nantemeshi, niSpiritu yindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova, nkúuli yeyi, Wajila waIsarela nindi, Yami Yehova Nzambi yeyi, yami nakulejaŋa mwakukuwahisha, yami nakulombolana njila yatela kuyaeyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yowe! Neyi watiyilili munakulejeli! Mutenowu kuwunda kweyikwadi kwinzala neyi kaloŋa, nikuloŋa kweyi kwadi kwikala neyi mankanda akukalunalwiji; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "anyaneyi adi kuvula neyi wusekulula, avwalika mwivumudeyi adi kuvula neyi tumabuji twawusekulula; ijina dindi hidadi kufwahela kujiya kumesu amuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fumenu muBabiloni, yitemukenu aKaladeya. Shimunenu nezuda tumina, tiyakeshenu chumichi, chishikijenu kunsa jampata, nenu, Yehova nakuuli kambuŋindi Yakoba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chayilombweliyi mwahita makuna akadimeji, hiyatiyili mpwilaku. Wayiidishilili meji mwilola. Eŋa, wabalwiliilola himukutupuka meji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nindi, Antu atama hiyamonaŋa akuwundaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
